{% macro r_gate(c) %}
<p>Replaying the gate's regression rule on the stored results (absolute ceilings switched off, since even the
hardened base is not at 0%): a fine-tune fails if its ASR rose by more than 2 points <em>and</em> the paired test is
significant. It flags {{ c.gate_counts.fail }} of the {{ c.gate_counts.total }} pilot fine-tunes:</p>
{% endmacro %}
